## Allowed Changes

Agents are permitted to:

- Fix bugs in existing functions when a failing test clearly identifies the issue
- Add new tests to the `tests/` directory
- Improve docstrings and inline comments for clarity
- Refactor code within a single module without changing the public API
- Update dependencies in `pyproject.toml` (or equivalent) with operator approval

