## Forbidden Changes

Agents **must not**:

- Delete or rename public API functions, classes, or CLI entry points without explicit operator approval
- Modify database schemas, migration files, or production configuration without operator approval
- Add external API calls, network requests, or telemetry of any kind
- Add LLM calls, AI model integrations, or paid API dependencies to the core scanner
- Expand the project scope beyond what is described in this file
- Commit `.env`, credential files, or any file containing real secrets
- Modify CI workflow files (`.github/workflows/`) without explicit operator approval
- Remove or weaken existing test assertions

